    "rating": 5,
    "reference": "ChIJWdd_QslJyUwRW9dTPYlWtoE",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Zac Sideris",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111106811393341577699/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_CSNefFJETdoZeex1ffqJ7lgxFrjFPBHy0mimEaAe3dKUtH4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Joining this gym has been one of the best decisions I’ve made! Coach Emil brings incredible energy and expertise to every session, making sure everyone is pushing their limits while still enjoying the process. His wife, Judith, and Julie are also amazing—they create such a welcoming atmosphere and are always there to motivate and support. Whether you’re a beginner or experienced, this gym feels like a second home. Highly recommend it to anyone looking to get stronger, both physically and mentally!",
        "time": 1734625204,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chrissy Salazar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102581064104510292724/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIcpzf60sh9I62CvwhXXQjFL5Xga9f5mh39p-W_t1t9CuT10w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The best new hidden gem in town! This gym offers multiple classes, from beginner to advance classes with great reputable instructors. I’ve never seen such a clean facility. Very big and bright space, very friendly environment! If you’re looking to learn from the best, I highly recommend this gym. I started here as a beginner and have seen significant improvement in my cardio and form when it comes to kickboxing! They also have an open gym to hit bags or do a workout in their conditioning room.\n\nThey also offer a multiple range of classes, from boxing to kickboxing to HIIT to Yoga. They also offer women’s kickboxing and kids classes :) I suggest to anyone to come for a free trial, I’m sure you’ll fall in love with this sport as much as I did coming here! Also- they have a Leone boutique! As well, one of their coaches has a massage/wellness room upstairs! An all in one gym hahah",
        "time": 1710339781,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Zackary Roy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107152465824138415513/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI3_56oGM4pN7LT-GGi2DenEait82OVmCnyI8xKhh8FiCF1Yg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Very good gym amazing staff and great equipment",
        "time": 1764003750,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "reid young",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103880781375419063042/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLghPIGU7iOgWmMRFrjn4rzTQWSn4V09xS5TAzuZvDSoTFr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Best place in the area to train if you are an experienced fighter or just starting out. Emil is a cut above and everyone is super positive and very welcoming .perfect place to work hard and they have a trained massage therapist on site available as well. The value for price is exceptional and really worth it .",
        "time": 1734806254,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
